+### Root Causes & Fixes Applied in Phase 3
+
+1. **Unneeded `after_create` Factory Cascades in `status_fabricator.rb` and `user_fabricator.rb`**
+   - Removed `after_create { |status| Fabricate(:bookmark, status: status) }` from `spec/fabricators/status_fabricator.rb`, which previously fabricated a new `Bookmark`, `Account`, `User`, and `Keypair` on every single `Fabricate(:status)` call (648 unnecessary `Bookmark` + `Account` + `User` + `Keypair` creations across `spec/models` and `spec/requests`).
+   - Removed `after_create { |user| 2.times { Fabricate(:login_activity, user: user) } }` from `spec/fabricators/user_fabricator.rb` (894 unnecessary `LoginActivity` creations across `spec/models` and `spec/requests`).
+
+2. **Duplicate Account/Association Cascades & Heavy Attachments/Crypto in Fabricators**
+   - **`spec/fabricators/poll_fabricator.rb` & `spec/fabricators/status_trend_fabricator.rb`**: Shared `account` between the parent record and its `status` (`attrs[:status]&.account` / `attrs[:account]`) instead of fabricating two separate `Account` + `User` + `Keypair` graphs per poll or status trend.
+   - **`spec/fabricators/notification_request_fabricator.rb`, `spec/fabricators/custom_filter_status_fabricator.rb`, `spec/fabricators/report_note_fabricator.rb`**: Shared `from_account` / `account` with child associations (`last_status`, `status`, `report`) instead of building redundant `Account`s.
+   - **`spec/fabricators/announcement_reaction_fabricator.rb`**: Used `ReactionValidator::SUPPORTED_EMOJIS` sequence for `name` instead of `Fabricate(:custom_emoji).shortcode`, avoiding Paperclip/ImageMagick `emojo.png` attachment processing when fabricating reactions.
+   - **`spec/fabricators/preview_card_trend_fabricator.rb`**: Passed `image: nil` when building `preview_card` (and in `moderation_action_spec.rb` and trend link request specs), avoiding 26 unnecessary Vips/BlurHash image processing runs.
+   - **`spec/fabricators/media_attachment_fabricator.rb`**: Used the 32x32 `mini-static.gif` fixture by default instead of the 600x400 `attachment.jpg` (which exceeded the 230,400px `:small` threshold and triggered extra thumbnail resizing) and reused `attrs[:status].account` when `status` is persisted.
+   - **`spec/fabricators/web_push_subscription_fabricator.rb` & `spec/fabricators/webauthn_credential_fabricator.rb`**: Memoized `OpenSSL::PKey::EC.generate('prime256v1')` key constants at load time instead of generating a new elliptic curve keypair per fabrication.
+   - **`spec/rails_helper.rb`**: Memoized `Devise::Encryptor.digest` in test environment to avoid redundant `BCrypt` hashing for identical test passwords across thousands of fabricated users, and required `test_prof` so `FPROF=1` works out of the box.
+
+3. **Shared Factory Setup (`let_it_be` / `before_all` / `stub_const`) in High-Factory-Count Model & Request Specs**
+   - **`spec/models`**: Shared `let_it_be` accounts/records in `media_attachment_spec.rb`, `collection_spec.rb` (including `stub_const('Collection::MAX_ITEMS', 3)` to avoid building 104 `collection_item`s + `account`s), `custom_emoji_filter_spec.rb`, `relationship_filter_spec.rb`, `web/push_subscription_spec.rb`, `fasp/backfill_request_spec.rb`, `report_spec.rb`, `notification_spec.rb`, `status_spec.rb`, `trends/statuses_spec.rb`, `concerns/account/interactions_spec.rb`, `account/search_spec.rb`, `appeal_spec.rb`, `account_conversation_spec.rb`, `follow_request_spec.rb`, `featured_tag_spec.rb`, `status_pin_spec.rb`, `user_role_spec.rb`, `announcement_spec.rb`, and `admin/moderation_action_spec.rb`.
+   - **`spec/requests`**: Shared `let_it_be` / `before_all` records in `api/v1/media_spec.rb`, `media_proxy_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses_spec.rb`, `api/v1/accounts_spec.rb`, `api/v1/in_collections_spec.rb`, `activitypub/followers_synchronizations_spec.rb`, `api/v1/accounts/{following,follower}_accounts_spec.rb`, `admin/collections_spec.rb`, `api/v1/reports_spec.rb`, `api/v1/instances/domain_blocks_spec.rb`, `api/v1/accounts/relationships_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses/{favourites,bookmarks,pins,reblogged_by_accounts}_spec.rb`, `api/v1/lists/accounts_spec.rb`, `api/v1/directories_spec.rb`, `api/v1/collection_items_spec.rb`, `api/v1/collections_spec.rb`, `api/v2/filters_spec.rb`, `api/web/embeds_spec.rb`, `well_known/webfinger_spec.rb`, `activitypub/{featured_collections,inboxes}_spec.rb`, `collections_spec.rb`, `api/v1/followed_tags_spec.rb`, `api/v1/admin/email_domain_blocks_spec.rb`, and `severed_relationships_spec.rb`.
+
+### Phase 3 Results
+- **FactoryProf (`spec/models` + `spec/requests`)**:
